==Old English==

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|ang|ǵews}}
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*keusaną}}, from {{der|ang|ine-pro|*ǵews-||taste, choose}}. Cognate with {{cog|ofs|kiāsa}}, {{cog|osx|kiosan}}, {{cog|goh|kiosan}}, {{cog|non|kjósa}}, {{cog|got|𐌺𐌹𐌿𐍃𐌰𐌽}}. The Indo-European root was also the source of {{cog|la|gustus||taste}}, {{cog|sq|desha||chosen}}.

